{"4553780":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Crystal Ascend","steam_appid":4553780,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Effortless Collection<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing incremental game where collecting is simple and satisfying. Just move your mouse to guide the absorption ring and enclose floating crystals—no clicking required. The ring automatically shatters them and harvests the aether within.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4553780\/extras\/55666774d9493d3f808ab01dfb7fdd2a.poster.avif?t=1793755894\" width=766 height=430 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4553780\/extras\/55666774d9493d3f808ab01dfb7fdd2a.webm?t=1793755894\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4553780\/extras\/55666774d9493d3f808ab01dfb7fdd2a.mp4?t=1793755894\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nurture Your Elementals<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather enough aether to upgrade your skill tree and enhance your absorption ring. Improve its efficiency and power to collect resources faster and more effectively.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4553780\/extras\/df443bd08985d68032021269fa21615e.poster.avif?t=1793755894\" width=766 height=430 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4553780\/extras\/df443bd08985d68032021269fa21615e.webm?t=1793755894\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4553780\/extras\/df443bd08985d68032021269fa21615e.mp4?t=1793755894\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock New Possibilities<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Successfully nurture an elemental companion to unlock new elemental seeds. Each one grows into a unique lifeform with its own skill tree, offering fresh mechanics and new ways to harvest aether—keeping your journey full of discovery.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4553780\/extras\/ca76073cac43b62cc343d065acd3938f.poster.avif?t=1793755894\" width=766 height=430 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4553780\/extras\/ca76073cac43b62cc343d065acd3938f.webm?t=1793755894\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4553780\/extras\/ca76073cac43b62cc343d065acd3938f.mp4?t=1793755894\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Effortless Collection<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing incremental game where collecting is simple and satisfying. Just move your mouse to guide the absorption ring and enclose floating crystals—no clicking required. The ring automatically shatters them and harvests the aether within.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4553780\/extras\/55666774d9493d3f808ab01dfb7fdd2a.poster.avif?t=1793755894\" width=766 height=430 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4553780\/extras\/55666774d9493d3f808ab01dfb7fdd2a.webm?t=1793755894\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4553780\/extras\/55666774d9493d3f808ab01dfb7fdd2a.mp4?t=1793755894\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nurture Your Elementals<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather enough aether to upgrade your skill tree and enhance your absorption ring. Improve its efficiency and power to collect resources faster and more effectively.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4553780\/extras\/df443bd08985d68032021269fa21615e.poster.avif?t=1793755894\" width=766 height=430 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4553780\/extras\/df443bd08985d68032021269fa21615e.webm?t=1793755894\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4553780\/extras\/df443bd08985d68032021269fa21615e.mp4?t=1793755894\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock New Possibilities<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Successfully nurture an elemental companion to unlock new elemental seeds. Each one grows into a unique lifeform with its own skill tree, offering fresh mechanics and new ways to harvest aether—keeping your journey full of discovery.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4553780\/extras\/ca76073cac43b62cc343d065acd3938f.poster.avif?t=1793755894\" width=766 height=430 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4553780\/extras\/ca76073cac43b62cc343d065acd3938f.webm?t=1793755894\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4553780\/extras\/ca76073cac43b62cc343d065acd3938f.mp4?t=1793755894\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"A simple incremental game where you nurture crystal elementals by destroying floating crystals and harvesting aether. Upgrade the skill tree, unlock new abilities to gather resources faster, and build your ultimate crystal companions.","supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Polish, Russian, Portuguese - Brazil, Traditional Chinese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4553780\/521777d3bd54474f1c9f0e2239992250cd2ecf84\/header.jpg?t=1793755894","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4553780\/72fc047f796d552d17f717bee3a412daeffbcf69\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793755894","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4553780\/72fc047f796d552d17f717bee3a412daeffbcf69\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793755894","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel i3\/AMD Ryzen 3<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Nvidia GTX 750\/AMD Radeon R7 260x<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel i5\/AMD Ryzen 5<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Nvidia GTX 4060\/AMD Radeon RX 7600<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 5 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"legal_notice":"